  (uuid_generate_v4(), '3-piece-pear-moissanite-engagement-ring-set-turquoise-stacking-wedding-bands-ros', '4614610280', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614610280/3-piece-pear-moissanite-engagement-ring?click_key=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%3ALTe4f041e4ed62303b4b936a19e11bbf3aa5c7a3bf&click_sum=ffe0951f&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-354064-18-24&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&content_source=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%253ALTe4f041e4ed62303b4b936a19e11bbf3aa5c7a3bf',
   '3-Piece Pear Moissanite Engagement Ring Set, Turquoise Stacking Wedding Bands, Rose Gold Bridal Set', 'Three bands, three promises: to cherish every moment, celebrate every milestone, and embrace the adventures yet to come. The brilliant pear-shaped white moissanite shines at the center, surrounded by vibrant turquoise accents that bring character and individuality to this distinctive design. A striking choice for a memorable proposal, wedding celebration, anniversary, or a gift that marks a new chapter in life. ⨞Handmade item ⨞Materials: 14k, 18k Gold, Rose gold, White gold Ring size can be choose from the selection box. ----Ring Descriptions---- ⨞Engagement ring -Center Stone - Moissanite Shape - Pear Size - 6*8mm -Side Stones - Turquoise & Moissanite Shape -Pear & Round Cut Weight - About 0.254ct -Band Width - About 1.5mm ⨞Wedding band(Top) -Gemstone - Turquoise & Moissanite Shape - Pear & Marquise & Round shaped Weight - About 0.28ct -Band Width - About 1.5mm ⨞Wedding band(Bottom) -Gemstone - Turquoise & Moissanite Shape - Marquise & Round shaped Weight - About 0.17ct -Band Width - About 1.3mm ⨞Our Service ⨞Custom & Engraving Service: Custom designs and engravings are offered. Share your design references or details with us to get started. ⨞Shipping Info: Production: 2–4 weeks | Transit: 3–6 days Free US shipping. Expedited shipping available for an extra $50 for faster delivery. ⨞Payment Plan: Flexible weekly/monthly installments available. Production starts at 50% deposit; shipment upon full payment. Message us to arrange. ⨞Returns: Message us within 7 days of delivery if unsatisfied. Non-custom items: Ship returns within 30 days. $100 restocking fee for non-defect returns. Final sale (no returns): Custom, engraved, full eternity & resized rings. ⨞ Warranty & Care: Loose stones: Free repair within 30 days. 31–90 days: Coverage for side stones (center stone & labor fees may apply). Over 90 days: Repairs assessed individually. Gold plating fades naturally from daily wear. Re-plating recommended every 6–12 months. Feel free to message us with any questions or cust', 'turquoise-jewelry',
