  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'black-tourmaline-necklace-natural-turquoise-pyrite-tribal-skulls-and-dark-wood-u', '4607602424', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4607602424/black-tourmaline-necklace-natural?click_key=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%3ALT6c70b140954f20aaf85138b878bb5ddc4f0d691b&click_sum=681dcd1e&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-354064-18-23&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%253ALT6c70b140954f20aaf85138b878bb5ddc4f0d691b',
   'Black Tourmaline Necklace: Natural Turquoise, Pyrite, Tribal Skulls and dark Wood, Unisex', 'This one-of-a-kind unisex necklace features genuine turquoise, shimmering pyrite, tiny tribal brass skulls, black onyx, African glass, and dark ebony wood beads. At its center sits a rough-cut black tourmaline nugget, preserving its natural, organic texture and making each necklace truly unique. A distinctive blend of earthy tones, natural gemstones, and tribal-inspired details creates a bold, timeless piece. ~~~~PLEASE NOTE: This item features natural, one of a kind raw Tourmaline. There will be slight variations in SHAPE and SIZE~~~~ Circumference: approx. 26” + 1.5” pendant. Black Tourmaline – A powerful protective stone believed to guard against negative energies of all kinds. It is also a grounding stone that promotes stability, balance, and a deeper connection to the present moment. Black Tourmaline is associated with aligning the body''s energy centers and encouraging a sense of inner harmony. It strengthens confidence, empowers the spirit, and helps you see the world with greater clarity and objectivity. Turquoise – A stone of transformation that opens the mind to new ideas, opportunities, and possibilities. It symbolizes balance, structure, and prosperity while encouraging personal growth and self-discovery. Turquoise is believed to awaken the soul, inspire positive change, and guide you toward your true purpose in life. A powerful protection stone, Black Onyx is known to absorb and transform negative energy, it also helps to prevent the drain of personal energy. Black Onyx aids the development of emotional and physical strength and stamina, it also encourages wise decision making. Pyrite stone meaning comes from the Greek word meaning fire. This fiery stone manifests energy of strength, that burning cauldron of passion that exists deep within the third eye chakra. Pyrite is a symbol of manifestation and abundance. *** Before shipping, all our malas and necklaces are cleansed with the smudge of sage to remove accumulated energies in the stones. They are read', 'turquoise-jewelry',
