  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'collection-of-4-bead-bracelets-gift-for-girls-jewelry-kids-children-s-stack-brac', '4614532461', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614532461/collection-of-4-bead-bracelets-gift-for?click_key=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%3ALT446f61a731921509989bc37e63ce6ae6e0d1d58d&click_sum=2088371a&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-354064-18-22&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&content_source=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%253ALT446f61a731921509989bc37e63ce6ae6e0d1d58d',
   'Collection of 4 Bead Bracelets, Gift for Girls, Jewelry Kids, Children''s Stack Bracelets Set', 'Stack them up or wear them one at a time. This set of four bright turquoise bracelets mixes glass seed beads, silver-tone spacers, and little blue and purple beaded flowers for a fun, colorful look. Each one is easy to slide on and off, so they’re great for everyday wear, school, sleepovers, and playdates. These make a sweet gift for girls, birthdays, Christmas, Easter, back to school, end-of-year treats, party favors, best friends, cousins, and anyone who loves bright colors and sparkle. PRODUCT DETAILS: Set includes: [4] stretch bracelets Beads: glass seed beads, silver-tone spacers, beaded flower accents Sizing: child/youth size, stretches to fit most wrists Materials: glass beads, elastic cord, metal-tone spacers Photos showing the bracelets stacked on a wrist are styling examples. The listing includes only the 4 bracelets described above. CARING TIPS: Keep away from water, lotion, perfume, and hairspray Take them off for swimming, showers, and play that could snag or pull the beads Roll bracelets on rather than stretching the elastic to get them over the hand Store them flat or in a small pouch to keep the beads from tangling', 'turquoise-jewelry',
