  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-native-american-sterling-silver-turquoise-hair-barrette-3-2', '1838839340', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1838839340/vintage-sterling-silver-925-turquoise?click_key=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%3ALTb2de7901bb274e0de094541f7b9ba7d919760fe2&click_sum=9b6d07d4&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-354064-18-19&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%253ALTb2de7901bb274e0de094541f7b9ba7d919760fe2',
   'Vintage Native American Sterling Silver Turquoise Hair Barrette, 3.2"', 'This beautiful vintage Native American sterling silver hair barrette features five oval turquoise stones set across the center in traditional sawtooth bezels. The bright turquoise stones show natural matrix and are framed by detailed stamped silverwork, scalloped edges, and decorative silver accents. The substantial size and bold Southwestern design give this piece wonderful presence while still remaining wearable as a functional hair accessory. The back is marked Sterling. The clip mechanism closes securely and is functional. There is some rust present on the metal clip portion from age and previous use, which is reflected in the condition and should be reviewed closely in the photographs. A wonderful piece for anyone who loves vintage turquoise jewelry, Southwestern silver work, Native American jewelry, or collectible handmade hair accessories. In very good vintage condition with some rust on the clip mechanism. Please review all photographs carefully, as they are considered part of the item description. Natural turquoise may show variations in color, matrix, and surface character. Details Metal: Sterling Silver Stones: Turquoise Design: Turquoise Inlay / Southwestern / Stamped Silver Style: Native American / Southwestern / Vintage Hair Jewelry Length: Approximately 3.2 inches Height: Approximately 0.96 inches Weight: Approximately 18.3 grams on my scale Marked: Sterling Closure: Metal Barrette Clip Clip Condition: Closes securely; some rust present on the clip portion Condition: Very good vintage condition Shipping & Packaging: Free fully insured shipping within the U.S. Ships next business day, including Saturdays. Carefully packaged and ready for gifting. Condition & Disclosure Due to the unique nature of antique and vintage items, all pieces are sold as is. Please note that most antique and vintage items will exhibit wear and imperfections consistent with age and normal use. We encourage you to carefully review all photographs provided, as they are considered ', 'turquoise-jewelry',
