  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'turquoise-snake-boot-charm-handmade-sterling-silver-rustic-western-bohemian-styl', '4606561036', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4606561036/turquoise-snake-boot-charm-handmade?click_key=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%3ALTac0918a59a0b0fa3426ac31d667ef79be51d3220&click_sum=0dfbcf2f&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-354064-18-18&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=d2bda76a-4a38-4ad8-9367-8aa2f8800d1e%253ALTac0918a59a0b0fa3426ac31d667ef79be51d3220',
   'Turquoise Snake Boot Charm, Handmade Sterling Silver Rustic Western Bohemian Style Jewelry', 'New to my shop!!! An idea came to me in the middle of the night one night and I had to make it come to life!! So, this is one of many that I made and will be making more. This is a boot charm, the silver clasp at the top slides over the top of your knee-high or even calf length boots. The turquoise charm dangles and adds a rustic piece of jewelry to your footwear that is truly one of a kind. I will be wearing these on all my boots, and I hope you will too!!! This listing is for a large snake charm with a deep blue turquoise stone. She has a fine silver bezel holding that stone in place and the snake body is sterling silver. She has been oxidized to bring out the details and give her that rustic vintage vibe I love!!! Measurements: Total length is 3.6". The snake is 1.4" x .6". All pictures are taken up close so you can see every detail, please reference size in the listing. Photos are not touched up, all are taken indoor and outdoor, sun vs shade. When you purchase from Crimson Buffalo you are getting a one-of-a-kind hand-crafted piece of jewelry. I do not use molds so no two pieces will ever be identical; each will have its own character and markings making them unique and adding to the beauty of a handmade piece of jewelry. I am so happy that you stopped by to take a look at my shop!! This piece is eligible for return; you must contact me within seven days of delivery, and you will be responsible for return shipping costs. A full refund will be given minus the original shipping charges. The piece must be returned in its original condition!!!', 'turquoise-jewelry',
   270.00, NULL, 'https://i.etsystatic.com/13738260/r/il/14c587/8827860490/il_1588xN.8827860490_dckz.jpg',
