   'The Basket Necklace Necklace', 'I found this sweet little basket on my last trip to Santa Fe, I could feel the energy of the person that made it from across the world from myself. I bought 3 all the vendor had to offer, I knew they were special and couldn''t wait to adorn them. This one has many treasures hanging from the bottom and a lovely beaded chain with turquoise beads and such. I love the way it hangs on me and compliments the other necklaces I wear often. I made it so the lenght can be adjusted. The basket pendant itself measures 5 inches long X 1 inch along the top, I put a piece of white fur in the basket but that can be easily removed to add your own dreams and wishes. It hangs from a 22 inch beaded chain but can easily be shortened with a lobster claw clasp attached to the chain. One of a kind.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
