  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'natural-turquoise-rondelle-beads-blue-turquoise-bead-strand-genuine-stone-beads-', '4573948942', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4573948942/natural-turquoise-rondelle-beads-blue?click_key=Eu3HcXCqWNREEYRy1tyabwQQEx63%3ALT95f6c0ed4026b1b338acb5e23a3cc6444e7d9afc&click_sum=bc85f227&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-354063-18-12&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1',
   'Natural Turquoise Rondelle Beads, Blue Turquoise Bead Strand, Genuine Stone Beads for Jewelry Making, Bracelet Necklace DIY Supplies', 'A versatile choice for both delicate and statement jewelry designs, these Turquoise Rondelle Beads feature classic blue and blue-green tones accented by distinctive matrix patterns. With four different sizes available, they can be used alone for a clean, coordinated look or mixed with other stones, pearls, charms, and spacers to create your own unique combinations. Their smooth, polished rondelle shape works beautifully for bracelets, necklaces, earrings, anklets, and a wide range of beading projects. Product Details Material: Turquoise Shape: Rondelle / Flat Round Color: Blue / Blue-Green with Variations Finish: Smooth & Polished Sold by Strand Drilled for Jewelry Making Available in 4 Sizes Size & Approximate Bead Count Per Strand 3 × 2mm — Approx. 210 beads per strand 4 × 2.5mm — Approx. 157 beads per strand 5 × 3mm — Approx. 128 beads per strand 6 × 4mm — Approx. 97 beads per strand 6 × 3mm — Approx. 117 beads per strand Perfect For Jewelry making, DIY bracelets, necklaces, earrings, anklets, beaded jewelry, gemstone jewelry, handmade gifts, craft projects, and other creative designs. Please Note Color, matrix pattern, texture, shape, and size may vary slightly from bead to bead. Brown, tan, or darker matrix markings may appear throughout the strand and contribute to the individual appearance of each bead. Because individual bead sizes and thicknesses may vary slightly, the number of beads on each strand may also vary. The quantities listed above are approximate and provided for reference only.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
