  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'tiny-hubei-turquoise-2mm-round-beaded-choker-bracelet-natural-blue-gemstone-bead', '1810988611', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1810988611/tiny-hubei-turquoise-2mm-round-beaded?click_key=Eu3HcXCqWNREEYRy1tyabwQQEx63%3ALT728cbbd0e1c8e4a80172432436a1640d25d01823&click_sum=5239b034&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-563633-18-3&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&bes=1&sts=1',
   'Tiny Hubei Turquoise 2mm Round Beaded Choker, Bracelet, Natural Blue Gemstone Beaded Necklace, Genuine Daily Necklace Gift for Her', 'This necklace features Hubei turquoise beads measuring 2mm in diameter. The small, delicate size of the beads offers a refined and elegant look, while the rich, natural hues of the Hubei turquoise—ranging from shades of vibrant blue to green, with natural matrix patterns—add a unique, earthy charm. The beaded design creates a minimalist yet striking piece, ideal for layering or wearing alone for a subtle pop of color. Perfect for those who appreciate the timeless beauty of natural stones, this necklace embodies both simplicity and sophistication. Hubei turquoise is a type of turquoise gemstone sourced from the Hubei province in China, known for its high-quality and vibrant color. The turquoise from this region often ranges from vivid blue to green and can feature natural matrix patterns, which are the intricate, dark veining or webbing that appears in the stone. ------------ Materials: Natural Turquoise, Gold/Silver Plated Metal. Turquoise Beads: 2mm Chain Extender Length: 2 inches Closure: Lobster Clasp ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- ❤SHIPPING Processing Time: 1-3 days Shipping Day: Monday, Wednesday, Friday USPS Ground Advantage(within the U.S ): 2-5 business days Free shipping on orders $50+ in the US. Use code: FREESHIPPING ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Packaging: The necklace/bracelet will come in a decorative jewelry pouch, making it suitable for gifting or safe storage. ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- ❤ Return and Refund If you are not happy with your purchase, I will refund your money. Just contact me within 14 days of delivery and ship items back to me within 30 days of delivery. Production partners EndiJewels makes this item with help from Cooperative Partner, San Francisco, CA', 'turquoise-jewelry',
