   'Pink Turquoise Cross Bracelet – Black and Cream Agate Stone Beaded Jewelry – Spiritual Christian Boho Bracelet by Beaded by Nature', 'Express your faith with a touch of soft, modern elegance through this spiritual natural gemstone cross bracelet from the Beaded by Nature Collection. Expertly handcrafted, this eye-catching piece features an oversized, horizontally set vibrant pink cross focal bead beautifully contrasted against high-contrast black and cream patterned Agate stones. Blending striking earthy textures with timeless religious style, it serves as a wonderful daily statement piece or an inspiring gift. Why You’ll Love It • Oversized Pink Cross Centerpiece: Showcases a large, beautifully smooth pink cross bead detailed with natural organic veining. • Striking Spotted Gemstones: Strung with high-quality, polished black and cream patterned beads that offer a distinct, modern contrast. • Gleaming Metallic Accents: Anchored by polished silver-tone spacer beads and completed with our authentic, double-sided "Beaded by Nature" stainless steel signature logo tag. • Durable Stretch Cord: Threaded onto high-durability elastic cord for smooth slip-on convenience and a comfortable fit throughout the day. Specifications • Materials: Pink Turquoise/Magnesite Cross, Patterned Jasper/Zebra Stone, Silver Sterling • Style: Religious, Christian, Spiritual, Southwestern Boho, Feminine Everyday Luxury • Packaging: Securely packaged in a signature, gift-ready presentation pouch. Bead Size: 10mm Bracelet Size: 7 * If desire size please message me * Care Instructions To keep the soft pink color looking fresh and protect the metallic shine, avoid direct contact with water, perfumes, heavy lotions, or soaps. Simply wipe down with a soft microfiber cloth after wearing.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
