   'Vintage Glo Mesh Necklace Choker Mid Century 1960s Australian Brand Christine Lynch Tagged Gold Tone Turquoise Flower Features Adjustable', 'Cute vintage gold tone glo mesh necklace. Features three triangular sections of mesh, highlighted with gold flowers and turquoise beads. Vintage Australian brand ''Christine Lynch'' from the 1960s. Length: Adjustable from 13"-17", 35cm-42cm All jewellery items have been hand/cloth polished, cleaned, and will be supplied with alcohol wipe. All jewellery safely sent in small recyclable box and packing, with tracked post. Due to tariffs and Australia Post changes, I am no longer able to offer complimentary postal insurance. Instead all items over $200 AUD will be sent requiring signature on delivery. All Customs/tariffs/taxes/extra charges are the responsibility of the recipient/buyer in the receiving country. All items over $120 AUD in value must be returned by tracked and insured postage. Please read shop policies or contact me for further information. It is now an Australia Post and international requirement to supply phone number or email details for delivery.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
